{'symbol': 'ETN', 'date': '2022-10-28 16:00:00', 'title': "NEW REPORT HIGHLIGHTS EATON'S EFFORTS TO BECOME A MODEL OF INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY IN ITS INDUSTRY", 'text': 'DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS PART OF ITS ONGOING COMMITMENT TO BECOMING A MODEL OF INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY (I&D) IN ITS INDUSTRY, INTELLIGENT POWER MANAGEMENT COMPANY EATON (NYSE:ETN), RELEASED ITS SECOND ANNUAL GLOBAL INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY TRANSPARENCY REPORT.'}